      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "最近你看起来精神好多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我也觉得。可能是睡得早了一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "还有你现在走路也比以前多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对。我发现不用一次做很多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "每天一点儿，反而更容易坚持。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "以前我总想一下子改变很多习惯。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "所以很快就觉得累。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "现在我只选两三件最重要的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "比如早点儿睡、每天走路？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，还有晚上少看一点儿手机。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这些都很实际。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "最重要的是我没有觉得压力很大。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "找到适合自己的节奏就好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "工作忙的时候我就少做一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "有空的时候再多走走、看看书。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样生活舒服多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "下一个目标是什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc020_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "继续学中文，不过也要记得休息。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
